{"id":"000UY0","title":"Fortress Fillomino - Zombie (11x9)","author":"Flinty","solvedCount":2,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-30T18:39:51+00:00","posted":"Heute, 16:45 Uhr","rules":"Special Thanks\n\nThis puzzle was created for Scojo's 2026 secret imposter setting challenge, where each participant prepared a puzzle in their own style and later prepared a puzzle in someone else's style to have the Twitch chat compare them during live solves, and guess the real setter. This was the puzzle I set in my own style back in the first week of September.\n\nIt wasn't feasible to set a new Dutch Flat Mates puzzle for the contest with that series coming to an end, as I would've needed to come up with a fresh idea within the rules of this challenge, and many of my ideas for the final run of puzzles were already set, or at least logically explored. So I turned to Fortress Fillomino, a constraint I love, and combined it with a constraint I invented. I am very proud that this will be my first puzzle published since the finale of the DFM series, and especially so that it will feature officially in ThePedallingPianist's wonderful series!\n\nPrevious Zombie puzzles:\n\n• Dutch Flat Mates (Zombie) - palpot collab\n\n• Outbreak!!\n\n• Bootmate Birthday Puzzle - by palpot\n\nInitial Setter Difficulty: 4.5 / 5\n\nclick image to play this week's Fortress Fillomino\n\nFORTRESS FILLOMINO:\n\n• Divide the grid into orthogonally connected regions and fill each cell with a number (not necessarily single-digit) showing the number of cells in the region to which it belongs;\n\n• Each region must be either strictly larger than all of its orthogonal neighbours or strictly smaller than all of its orthogonal neighbours.\n\nZOMBIE CAGES:\n\n• Numbers in cages must sum to the total in the top-left corner, and numbers cannot repeat within a cage. Not all cage totals are given.\n\n• ALL cages must grow by at least one orthogonally connected cell (could be more!), spreading like a zombie infection. Cages cannot share cells.\n\nNote: For answer check, enter just the ones digit for any double-digit numbers.","solutionCode":"Row 7","tags":["Fillomino","Fortress (Variante)","Killer (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/yjh4es46e1","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/yjh4es46e1","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":11,"cols":11,"cages":8,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-30T18:39:51+00:00"}